{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And the field of Ephron was established.</b> It gained an establishment — that it passed from the hand of a private person into the hand of a king. And the plain sense of the verse is: 'וַיָּקָם הַשָּׂדֶה וְהַמְּעָרָה אֲשֶׁר בּוֹ וְכָל הָעֵץ לְאַבְרָהָם לְמִקְנָה' and so forth."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:04.156753405Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}